      "prompt_id": "5b450986c9c3415abd09fbaa",
      "query": "Question:\nUsing Windows and default settings, which of the following can transpose some notes?\n\nChoices:\nA. Select the notes, then press Left or Right direction keys.\nB. Press F10 to open the transposition dialog, then select the target key you want to transpose to.\nC. Selecting some notes then pressing \"Ctrl + Up or Down\" can tranpose the notes chromatically.\nD. If no notes are selected, ticking \"Transpose Chromatically\" in the transposition dialog will transpose all the notes.\n\nEnd with exactly one line: Answer: X",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "label": "No note selection means all notes; chromatic transpose procedure",
          "token_span": [
            53272,
            53363
          ],
          "L20_C4_rows": 23,
