          "completion": "The handbook states that pressing `Ctrl+↑` or `Ctrl+↓` transposes notes by an octave, and the `↑` or `↓` keys transpose chromatically. It also says that in the Transpose dialog, if no notes are selected, it means \"select all.\"  \n\nAnswer: D"
        }
